    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Your car discount? You might quietly pay it back. Here's how.",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.83,
        "window": 4.27,
        "fill": 0.897
      },
      {
        "scene": "promise",
        "text": "Picture a new car, and the dealer knocks $2,000 off. You borrow the other $33,000, and that loan is where the discount can quietly return.",
        "start": 4.57,
        "seconds": 9.82,
        "window": 10.27,
        "fill": 0.956
      },
      {
        "scene": "before",
        "text": "Before you sign, a lender approves your loan at 6%. Over 60 months, that's $638 a month.",
        "start": 14.83,
        "seconds": 7.52,
        "window": 7.9,
        "fill": 0.952
      },
      {
        "scene": "change",
        "text": "But some dealers can add a couple of points to that rate before you see it, so your paper says 8%.",
        "start": 22.73,
        "seconds": 5.71,
        "window": 6.1,
        "fill": 0.936
      },
      {
        "scene": "doubt",
        "text": "Only $31 more a month? That's nothing next to my discount.",
        "start": 28.83,
        "seconds": 3.75,
        "window": 4.13,
        "fill": 0.908
      },
      {
        "scene": "after",
        "text": "Over 60 payments, that's $1,868 more interest, almost the whole discount, and the dealer keeps a share as a fee from the lender.",
        "start": 32.97,
        "seconds": 9.1,
        "window": 9.7,
        "fill": 0.938
      },
      {
        "scene": "turn",
        "text": "Here's the clever part. The discount comes off the price, but the loan can take it back, one payment at a time, and the dealer gets a cut.",
        "start": 42.67,
        "seconds": 6.76,
        "window": 7.4,
        "fill": 0.914
      },
      {
        "scene": "payoff",
        "text": "So the dealer can earn twice: once on the car, and again with a cut of your loan. That $1,868 comes out of the buyer's pocket, a little every month.",
        "start": 50.07,
        "seconds": 10.22,
        "window": 10.87,
        "fill": 0.94
      },
      {
        "scene": "loop",
        "text": "So the discount can come back? Then think again about your car discount.",
        "start": 60.93,
        "seconds": 3.38,
        "window": 3.77,
        "fill": 0.897
      }
    ]
